From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KadirJeager <KadirJeager@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] FaceSense: Googlebook OS port for the Galaxy Tab S7
 (SM-T870)

- Platform enrollment through ISenseServiceReceiver
  (onStartPlatformEnroll, onCancelPlatformEnroll).
- Persistent camera foreground service that serves every user
  (INTERACT_ACROSS_USERS), allowed in power and data saver.
- Built outside the platform build system: DeviceDefault themes
  instead of SetupWizard, public system palette colours instead of
  private ones, resizeable activities for the tablet.
- Empty enrollment guidance page in the overlay config.
